message: If you use this software or its research record, cite it as below.
title: Quantum Powerhouse (QP-Core)
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sadeqi
    given-names: Said Mohaddes
url: https://quantum.sadeqi.me
repository-code: https://github.com/Quantum-Powerhouse/QP-Core
abstract: >-
  A browser based quantum computing site: a from scratch statevector and
  density matrix engine, 26 interactive instruments, a circuit sandbox, a
  variational eigensolver, and a primary source verified research study of
  regression testing for quantum software.
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - statevector simulation
  - quantum education
  - regression testing
license: MIT
